.695" end="36.353" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.695" end="31.224">鼻</span><span begin="31.224" end="31.544">に</span><span begin="31.544" end="32.948">か</span><span begin="32.948" end="33.191">か</span><span begin="33.191" end="34.138">る</span> <span begin="34.602" end="34.825">じゃ</span><span begin="34.825" end="35.025">れ</span><span begin="35.025" end="35.333">た</span><span begin="35.333" end="36.064">声</span><span begin="36.064" end="36.353">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还是带着鼻音的说笑声</span></p><p begin="36.353" end="40.687" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.353" end="36.884">そ</span><span begin="36.884" end="37.240">の</span><span begin="37.240" end="37.837">小</span><span begin="37.837" end="38.328">さ</span><span begin="38.328" end="39.551">な</span><span begin="39.551" end="39.717">手</span><span begin="39.717" end="40.687">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">抑或是这双稚嫩的小手</span></p><p begin="41.199" end="47.357" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.199" end="41.413">上</span><span begin="41.413" end="41.615">手</span><span begin="41.615" end="41.803">く</span><span begin="41.803" end="42.647">笑</span><span begin="42.647" end="43.061">え</span><span begin="43.061" end="43.550">ない</span><span begin="43.874" end="44.390">君</span><span begin="44.390" end="44.697">が</span> <span begin="44.697" end="46.136">笑</span><span begin="46.136" end="46.353">え</span><span begin="46.353" end="47.357">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若不擅长展露出笑颜的你 微笑的话</span></p><p begin="47.779" end="54.787" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.779" end="48.003">あ</span><span begin="48.003" end="48.149">の</span><span begin="48.149" end="48.513">日</span><span begin="48.513" end="48.828">見</span><span begin="48.828" end="49.188">た</span><span begin="49.188" end="50.020">夢</span><span begin="50.020" end="50.455">が</span><span begin="50.455" end="51.064">ま</span><span begin="51.064" end="51.183">た</span><span begin="51.183" end="52.677">一</span><span begin="52.677" end="52.810">つ</span> <span begin="53.118" end="54.568">叶</span><span begin="54.568" end="54.787">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那日所做的梦便又实现了一个</span></p><p begin="55.117" end="1:07.164" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.117" end="55.363">行</span><span begin="55.363" end="55.989">き</span><span begin="55.989" end="56.207">交</span><span begin="56.207" end="56.737">う</span><span begin="56.737" end="57.219">他</span><span begin="57.219" end="57.634">人</span><span begin="57.634" end="58.019">た</span><span begin="58.019" end="58.677">ち</span><span begin="58.677" end="59.949">の</span><span begin="1:00.253" end="1:01.041">幸</span><span begin="1:01.041" end="1:02.080">せ</span> <span begin="1:02.374" end="1:02.574">自</span><span begin="1:02.574" end="1:02.998">分</span><span begin="1:02.998" end="1:03.391">の</span><span begin="1:03.391" end="1:03.810">こ</span><span begin="1:03.810" end="1:04.236">と</span><span begin="1:04.236" end="1:04.417">の</span><span begin="1:04.417" end="1:04.858">よ</span><span begin="1:04.858" end="1:05.046">う</span><span begin="1:05.046" end="1:07.164">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有交集的他人的幸福，如同自己的事一般</span></p><p begin="1:07.470" end="1:13.390" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.470" end="1:07.696">ど</span><span begin="1:07.696" end="1:07.824">う</span><span begin="1:07.824" end="1:09.365">し</span><span begin="1:09.365" end="1:09.589">て</span> <span begin="1:09.589" end="1:10.696">ねぇ</span> <span begin="1:11.019" end="1:12.642">願</span><span begin="1:12.642" end="1:12.843">う</span><span begin="1:12.843" end="1:13.390">の？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">为什么，呐，要为此祈祷呢？</span></p><p begin="1:13.627" end="1:21.435" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.627" end="1:14.461">君</span><span begin="1:14.461" end="1:14.867">に</span><span begin="1:15.108" end="1:15.298">逢</span><span begin="1:15.298" end="1:15.591">え</span><span begin="1:15.591" end="1:15.878">た</span><span begin="1:15.878" end="1:16.120">こ</span><span begin="1:16.120" end="1:16.558">と</span> <span begin="1:16.947" end="1:17.785">本</span><span begin="1:17.785" end="1:18.608">当</span><span begin="1:18.608" end="1:19.429">に</span><span begin="1:19.429" end="1:19.845">よ</span><span begin="1:19.845" end="1:20.247">か</span><span begin="1:20.247" end="1:20.820">っ</span><span begin="1:20.820" end="1:21.059">た</span><span begin="1:21.059" end="1:21.435">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“能与你相逢，真的太好了”</span></p><p begin="1:21.741" end="1:26.588" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.741" end="1:22.496">そう</span><span begin="1:22.496" end="1:22.706">言</span><span begin="1:22.706" end="1:23.514">え</span><span begin="1:23.514" end="1:23.592">る</span> <span begin="1:23.858" end="1:24.161">そ</span><span begin="1:24.161" end="1:24.345">の</span><span begin="1:24.345" end="1:24.579">笑</span><span begin="1:24.579" end="1:24.995">顔</span><span begin="1:24.995" end="1:25.580">を</span><span begin="1:25.580" end="1:25.995">守</span><span begin="1:25.995" end="1:26.201">り</span><span begin="1:26.201" end="1:26.420">た</span><span begin="1:26.420" end="1:26.588">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如此这么说 想要守护那份笑容</span></p><p begin="1:26.829" end="1:34.602" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.829" end="1:27.232">来</span><span begin="1:27.232" end="1:27.545">年</span><span begin="1:27.545" end="1:27.970">も</span> <span begin="1:28.171" end="1:28.473">再</span><span begin="1:28.473" end="1:28.788">来</span><span begin="1:28.788" end="1:29.298">年</span><span begin="1:29.298" end="1:29.639">も</span> <span begin="1:29.868" end="1:30.311">今</span><span begin="1:30.311" end="1:30.428">以</span><span begin="1:30.428" end="1:30.930">上</span><span begin="1:30.930" end="1:31.713">に</span> <span begin="1:31.713" end="1:32.956">君</span><span begin="1:32.956" end