gin="3:23.754" end="3:24.169">も</span><span begin="3:24.169" end="3:24.561">が</span><span begin="3:24.561" end="3:24.988">僕</span><span begin="3:24.988" end="3:25.379">の</span><span begin="3:25.379" end="3:25.991">胸</span><span begin="3:25.991" end="3:27.249">を</span><span begin="3:27.249" end="3:27.439">打</span><span begin="3:27.439" end="3:27.930">つ</span> <span begin="3:28.249" end="3:28.366">抱</span><span begin="3:28.366" end="3:28.450">き</span><span begin="3:28.450" end="3:28.792">し</span><span begin="3:28.792" end="3:29.097">め</span><span begin="3:29.097" end="3:32.364">た</span><span begin="3:32.364" end="3:32.583">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但你的每一面都打动着我的心，使我想要珍藏心中</span></p><p begin="3:41.583" end="3:49.352" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:41.583" end="3:41.946">も</span><span begin="3:41.946" end="3:42.452">し</span><span begin="3:42.452" end="3:42.825">も</span><span begin="3:43.062" end="3:43.502">悲</span><span begin="3:43.502" end="3:43.898">し</span><span begin="3:43.898" end="3:44.113">み</span><span begin="3:44.113" end="3:44.553">に</span><span begin="3:44.881" end="3:45.722">包</span><span begin="3:45.722" end="3:46.568">ま</span><span begin="3:46.568" end="3:47.384">れ</span><span begin="3:47.384" end="3:47.808">た</span><span begin="3:47.808" end="3:48.215">な</span><span begin="3:48.215" end="3:48.799">ら</span> <span begin="3:48.799" end="3:49.058">僕</span><span begin="3:49.058" end="3:49.352">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若你被悲伤包裹</span></p><p begin="3:49.623" end="3:54.353" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:49.623" end="3:50.337">今</span><span begin="3:50.337" end="3:50.665">す</span><span begin="3:50.665" end="3:51.470">ぐ</span> <span begin="3:51.841" end="3:52.316">君</span><span begin="3:52.316" end="3:52.496">に</span><span begin="3:52.496" end="3:52.694">逢</span><span begin="3:52.694" end="3:52.950">い</span><span begin="3:52.950" end="3:53.371">に</span><span begin="3:53.371" end="3:53.742">行</span><span begin="3:53.742" end="3:53.919">く</span><span begin="3:53.919" end="3:54.353">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我此刻便会前去与你相会</span></p><p begin="3:54.788" end="4:02.499" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:54.788" end="3:55.585">届</span><span begin="3:55.585" end="3:55.991">け</span> <span begin="3:56.240" end="3:56.746">今</span><span begin="3:56.746" end="3:57.243">届</span><span begin="3:57.243" end="3:57.695">け</span> <span begin="3:58.031" end="3:58.879">君</span><span begin="3:58.879" end="3:59.713">に</span><span begin="3:59.713" end="4:00.490">言</span><span begin="4:00.490" end="4:00.865">え</span><span begin="4:00.865" end="4:01.334">ず</span><span begin="4:01.334" end="4:01.962">に</span><span begin="4:01.962" end="4:02.153">い</span><span begin="4:02.153" end="4:02.499">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">传达吧 此刻向你传达 无法对你说出口的</span></p><p begin="4:02.773" end="4:07.716" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:02.773" end="4:02.984">「I</span> <span begin="4:02.984" end="4:03.830">love</span> <span begin="4:03.830" end="4:04.609">you」</span> <span begin="4:04.971" end="4:05.228">そ</span><span begin="4:05.228" end="4:05.438">の</span><span begin="4:05.438" end="4:06.071">心</span><span begin="4:06.071" end="4:06.687">の</span><span begin="4:06.687" end="4:06.908">真</span><span begin="4:06.908" end="4:07.076">ん</span><span begin="4:07.076" end="4:07.517">中</span><span begin="4:07.517" end="4:07.716">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“我爱你（I love you）” 向着那份内心的正中</span></p><p begin="4:07.929" end="4:15.699" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:07.929" end="4:08.345">来</span><span begin="4:08.345" end="4:08.745">年</span><span begin="4:08.745" end="4:09.060">も</span> <span begin="4:09.281" end="4:09.559">再</span><span begin="4:09.559" end="4:09.901">来</span><span begin="4:09.901" end="4:10.382">年</span><span begin="4:10.382" end="4:10.758">も</span> <span begin="4:11.007" end="4:11.424">今</span><span begin="4:11.424" end="4:11.584">以</span><span begin="4:11.584" end="4:12.035">上</span><span begin="4:12.035" end="4:12.836">に</span> <span begin="4:12.836" end="4:14.087">君</span><span begin="4:14.087" end="4:14.356">が</span><span begin="4:14.356" end="4:14.506">好</span><span begin="4:14.506" end="4:15.116">き</span><span begin="4:15.116" end="4:15.699">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论几度时光流逝，我都会比现在更加喜欢你</span></p><p begin="4:15.844" end="4:20.980" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:15.844" end="4:16.129">そ</span><span begin="4:16.129" end="4:16.761">れ</span><span begin="4:16.761" end="4:16.970">ぐ</span><span begin="4:16.970" end="4:17.775">ら</span><span begin="4:17.775" end="4:18.001">い</span> <span begin="4:18.209" end="4:18.616">僕</span><span begin="4:18.616" end="4:18.914">の</span><span begin="4:18.914" end="4:19.223">す</span><span begin="4:19.223" end="4:19.648">べ</span><span begin="4:19.648" end="4:19.848">て</span><span begin="4:19.848" end="4:20.980">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那种程度，就用我的一切来兑现</span></p><p begin="4:21.471" end="4:28.838" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:21.471" end="4:22.370">僕</span><span begin="4:22.707" end="4:22.951">に</span><span begin="4:22.951" end="4:23.122">し</span><span begin="4:23.122" end="4:23.392">か</span><span begin="4:23.392" end="4:23.525">言</span><span begin="4:23.525" end="4:24.164">え</span><span begin="4:24.164" end="4:24.352">な</span><span begin="4:24.352" end="4:24.738">い</span><span begin="4:25.152" end="4:25.804">言</span><span begin="4:25.804" end="4:26.216">葉</span><span begin="4:26.216" end="4:26.625">を</span> <span begin="4:26.625" end="4:26.803">見</span><span begin="4:26.803" end="4:27.216">つ</span><span begin="4:27.216" end="4:27.446">け</span><span begin="4:27.446" end="4:27.864">た</span><span begin="4:27.864" end="4:28.248">か</span><span begin="4:28.248" end="4:28.838">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为已经找到了那份只能由我说出口的话语</span></p><p begin="4:29.293" end="4:39.889" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:29.293" end="4:30.753">心</span><span begin="4:30.753" end="4:30.932">ま</span><span begin="4:30.932" end="4:31.280">で</span><span begin="4:31.550" end="4:31.760">交</span><span begin="4:31.760" end="4:31.957">わ</span><span begin="4:31.957" end="4:32.178">し</span><span begin="4:32.178" end="4:32.381">た</span><span begin="4:32.381" end="4:32.789">い</span><span begin="4:32.789" end="4:33.543">想</span><span begin="4:33.543" end="4:33.792">い</span> <span begin="4:33.792" end="4:34.433">君</span><span begin="4:34.433" end="4:34.821">に</span><span begin="4:34.821" end="4:36.048">届</span><span begin="4:36.048" end="4:36.281">け</span><span begin="4:36.281" end="4:36.621">た</span><span begin="4:36.621" end="4:39.889">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以这份直至两人内心都相交一起的思慕，想要传达给你</span></p></div></body></tt>